    "detailed_description": "Crimson Dawn is a bullet hell survival game inspired by Vampire Survivors. Each run for one of several unique characters makes you stronger by unlocking new talents, weapons, and combinations. Create your own build in the Hub and survive all 5 stages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Roguelite horde survival game with RPG progression system;<br></li><li>Level up your characters and upgrade their weapons and spells;<br></li><li>Choose one of the weapons with its own unique game mechanic;<br></li><li>Relaxing, satisfying gameplay.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Thousands of Creatures Without a Single Click!</h2>All weapons and spells attack automatically, so all you have to do is avoid enemies and try to survive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/d911cbb5aad61dd9e81ada5f55d0b416.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/d911cbb5aad61dd9e81ada5f55d0b416.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/d911cbb5aad61dd9e81ada5f55d0b416.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Freedom of Choice</h2>You decide how many quests you want to take on and what you\u2019re willing to risk. More quests mean stronger monsters\u2014or maybe even bosses\u2014but also better loot.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/c2420cf0bd8751d6bef0ac8e35274bf2.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/c2420cf0bd8751d6bef0ac8e35274bf2.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/c2420cf0bd8751d6bef0ac8e35274bf2.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rest in the Hub</h2>This is your home and the only place to take a breather between battles. Rest at the Inn, visit the Blacksmith, or exchange resources at the Market.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/fab0ea51382e9f93a3d8ae9dda9885de.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/fab0ea51382e9f93a3d8ae9dda9885de.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/fab0ea51382e9f93a3d8ae9dda9885de.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Development</h2>During fights, you earn materials and coins. Use them to get new abilities, upgrade weapons, or even unlock new characters. Each quest you complete will earn you even more resources.<br>Every weapon in the game has its own upgrade tree, as well as its own game mechanics.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/497c50f100844a6a718909602a577eca.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/497c50f100844a6a718909602a577eca.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/497c50f100844a6a718909602a577eca.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Crimson Dawn is a bullet hell survival game inspired by Vampire Survivors. Each run for one of several unique characters makes you stronger by unlocking new talents, weapons, and combinations. Create your own build in the Hub and survive all 5 stages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Roguelite horde survival game with RPG progression system;<br></li><li>Level up your characters and upgrade their weapons and spells;<br></li><li>Choose one of the weapons with its own unique game mechanic;<br></li><li>Relaxing, satisfying gameplay.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Thousands of Creatures Without a Single Click!</h2>All weapons and spells attack automatically, so all you have to do is avoid enemies and try to survive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/d911cbb5aad61dd9e81ada5f55d0b416.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/d911cbb5aad61dd9e81ada5f55d0b416.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/d911cbb5aad61dd9e81ada5f55d0b416.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Freedom of Choice</h2>You decide how many quests you want to take on and what you\u2019re willing to risk. More quests mean stronger monsters\u2014or maybe even bosses\u2014but also better loot.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/c2420cf0bd8751d6bef0ac8e35274bf2.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/c2420cf0bd8751d6bef0ac8e35274bf2.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/c2420cf0bd8751d6bef0ac8e35274bf2.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rest in the Hub</h2>This is your home and the only place to take a breather between battles. Rest at the Inn, visit the Blacksmith, or exchange resources at the Market.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/fab0ea51382e9f93a3d8ae9dda9885de.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/fab0ea51382e9f93a3d8ae9dda9885de.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/fab0ea51382e9f93a3d8ae9dda9885de.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Development</h2>During fights, you earn materials and coins. Use them to get new abilities, upgrade weapons, or even unlock new characters. Each quest you complete will earn you even more resources.<br>Every weapon in the game has its own upgrade tree, as well as its own game mechanics.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/497c50f100844a6a718909602a577eca.poster.avif?t=1700818479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/497c50f100844a6a718909602a577eca.webm?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1919720/extras/497c50f100844a6a718909602a577eca.mp4?t=1700818479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Crimson Dawn is a roguelite horde survival game with RPG elements. Recruit mercenaries and survive 5 stages by fighting the hordes of evil. Unlock more characters and weapons with unique abilities. Carve your path to stop the hordes of evil once and for all!",
